{"id":"bravo","lemma":"bravo","pos":"adj","rank":1446,"glosses":["angry, furious","bold, courageous","skilful, capable, clever, fine"],"ipa":"/ˈbɾabo/","forms":{"feminine":"brava","masculinePlural":"bravos","femininePlural":"bravas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-bravo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Cuidado, es un toro bravo.","en":"Be careful. It's a fierce bull."},{"text":"Los burros son animales bravos.","en":"Donkeys are tough animals."},{"text":"Bravo, amigos míos.","en":"Well done, guys.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/637201"}]}